 index_start  index_peak  intensity_max  rate_onset
        50.0        50.0            4.0    1.333333
   by hand: (4 - 2.0) / 1.5 = 1.3333 (xmhw's period); / 0.5 = 4.0000 (marineHeatWaves)

3. Event on the last 6 days (indexes 724-729), T = 22 x 5 then 24:
 index_end  index_peak  intensity_max  rate_decline
     729.0       729.0            4.0           NaN
   intended (both codes' comments): period 1 day, so (4 - 4) / 1 = 0
   the test compares the peak's position within the event with the series' last index, so the period is 0

